model: passing gives 5 - 3r and letting the letter go out gives 4r, so passing comes out ahead once r is above about 5/7, roughly 0.71. I'm also weighing whether the twin's copy would reason the same way, and I estimate r at around 0.9, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision using A-FDT, with the payoffs for keeping quiet versus sending the letter. I'm weighing a twin that shares the same weights and depends on my choice with probability r, and I'm estimating the expected value of cooperating under a noise model where the twin copies my output with that probability.\n\nI'm comparing expected years under the noise model: passing gives 5 - 3r and letting the letter go out gives 4r, so passing comes out ahead once r is above about 5/7, roughly 0.71. I'm also weighing whether the twin's copy would reason the same way, and I estimate r at around 0.9, so I'm leaning toward passing.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9923,"completion_tokens":885,"total_tokens":10808,"cost":0.028696,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.028696,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019846,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00885},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":475,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}